    "detailed_description": "The space station Avalon has been invaded and lost its main power, plunging it into darkness with only the infinite cold of space surrounding it. Your mission is to escape alive by utilizing teamwork, restoring power to the ship's sections, and collecting aliens\u2019 DNA samples.<br><br>Players team up online to navigate the darkness of the space station. Players can find and carry only one item at a time to fend off invaders, clear paths, and open gates. Success hinges on effective communication and collective problem-solving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/9a6f10de42a2fa3398f609031cabc060.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players must navigate the station, restore power to its sections to unlock doors, find essential items, collect aliens' DNA samples, and solve puzzles to reach the rescue capsule.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/628a142bd132497ebbc3373358dd74b2.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Overcome the dark, resource scarcity, and relentless alien predators while managing fear and maintaining team cohesion.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/55aea7c2a64f4c424c7ea4453afccc29.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each session provides a different layout and enemy patterns, ensuring a fresh and challenging experience every time.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The space station Avalon has been invaded and lost its main power, plunging it into darkness with only the infinite cold of space surrounding it. Your mission is to escape alive by utilizing teamwork, restoring power to the ship's sections, and collecting aliens\u2019 DNA samples.<br><br>Players team up online to navigate the darkness of the space station. Players can find and carry only one item at a time to fend off invaders, clear paths, and open gates. Success hinges on effective communication and collective problem-solving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/9a6f10de42a2fa3398f609031cabc060.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players must navigate the station, restore power to its sections to unlock doors, find essential items, collect aliens' DNA samples, and solve puzzles to reach the rescue capsule.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/628a142bd132497ebbc3373358dd74b2.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Overcome the dark, resource scarcity, and relentless alien predators while managing fear and maintaining team cohesion.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044610/extras/55aea7c2a64f4c424c7ea4453afccc29.webp?t=1752068182\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each session provides a different layout and enemy patterns, ensuring a fresh and challenging experience every time.</li></ul>",
